Build and install notes
=======================

Build the command line encoder with the maintained top-level Makefile:

    make

Build only the static library:

    make lib

The static library is self-contained: libmp3lame/libmp3lame.a includes the
MP3 decoder support objects from mpglib.

Install the static library and public header:

    make install PREFIX=/usr/local

This installs:

    $(PREFIX)/lib/libmp3lame.a
    $(PREFIX)/include/lame/lame.h

Use DESTDIR for staged packaging installs:

    make install DESTDIR=/tmp/package PREFIX=/usr

Run the encoder smoke test:

    make test

Remove generated build outputs:

    make clean

The build uses the checked-in config.h and does not require autotools,
configure, automake, or libtool.

Useful overrides:

    make CC=clang
    make CFLAGS="-O2 -Wall"
    make LDFLAGS="..."
    make lib PIC=1

The default target builds:

    frontend/lame
    libmp3lame/libmp3lame.a
